+# Frozen candidate, fresh heldout validation
+
+Use this page when considering weighted MoE SwiGLU on BI-V150/CoreX4.2. The stage34 candidate004 is unchanged (SHA256 `b9a2ca76c294481e38e2422332ccb821224bd64b8bb7cd61d972a5e2a4a9133e`). Cache compiled Triton callables while preserving the native BF16 intermediate rounding and router-weight gradient. The configured Claude Code CLI/Paratera Claude-Opus-4.8 review used the project skill before freeze; its original review is archived. No shape-specific retuning was performed.
