+## Measurement and exclusions
+
+Timing is the unchanged native GPU-synchronized time.time loop:3 seeds, rotated3 arms,120 steps per process, first20 excluded and10 retained interval10 means. No profiling, tensor capture, checkpoint, evaluation or large backup runs during timing. Operator CUDA Event measurements remain separate. Accepted rounds total18 processes/2160 timed/1800 retained steps. Strict promotion requires >1% geometric throughput over same-round control AND all3 seeds faster, with full repeats when predeclared CV requires them.
